@using CrossBuy.BL.Reporting
@using System.Globalization
@inject Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Localization.IHtmlLocalizer<CrossBuy.SharedResources> SR
@model ReportStudioModel
@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_LayoutInventory.cshtml";
    var arabic = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName == "ar";
    ViewData["Title"] = arabic ? "استوديو التقارير" : "Report Studio";
    var openDraft = ViewData["StudioOpenDraft"] as StudioDraft;
}
@*
    ============================================================================================
    THE REPORT STUDIO — V2, THE VISUAL DESIGNER.

    V1 built a column list. This builds a DOCUMENT: a printable page with margins, seven bands, and
    elements the user places, moves, resizes and styles wherever they want them on it.

    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    THE ONE INVARIANT THIS SCREEN IS BUILT AROUND (§14):

        WHAT IS SAVED IS STRUCTURE, NEVER THIS DOM.

    Every drag, resize and nudge below edits a plain JavaScript object — bands, elements, millimetres —
    and that object is what is POSTed, validated server-side and persisted. The HTML on this page is a
    VIEW of that object and is rebuilt from it after every change. Nothing is ever read back out of the
    DOM to be saved. That is why a saved report survives this file changing, and why the server can
    refuse a layout it does not like without having to parse markup.

    MILLIMETRES, NOT PIXELS. Positions are stored in mm because the output is paper; px would only mean
    something at one zoom on one screen. The canvas multiplies by a scale factor for display and divides
    on the way back, and that is the only place the two units meet.

    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    VISUAL AUTHORITY: THE INVENTORY MODULE, as the corrected Studio contract §0 records. There is no
    Studio theme and no Studio shell — the page chrome, cards, buttons and inputs are Inventory's
    (_LayoutInventory.cshtml, card / card-header / card-body, btn btn-sm btn-light, form-control-sm).

    The CANVAS is the one exception and is deliberately its own thing: a sheet of paper, a ruler and a
    selection handle have no Metronic equivalent, and dressing them as cards would make a design surface
    that lies about what it is. Its styles are scoped under .cbd- and touch nothing else.

    STRINGS ARE INLINE BILINGUAL rather than resx, the same deliberate choice V1 recorded:
    CrossBuy/Resources/** belongs to the integration owner in the ownership registry, and CLAUDE.md
    records that resx edits collide with the plumbing other tabs use.

    RTL IS ONE LAYOUT, NOT TWO. Element X is a distance from the CONTENT START edge and is emitted as
    `inset-inline-start` — here on the canvas and identically in ReportVisualRenderer. The browser
    resolves it against `dir`, so the same saved document is correct in both directions and there is no
    mirrored copy to keep in step. Drag deltas are negated under RTL for the same reason: the pointer
    moves in screen space, the model lives in logical space.

    NO DEMO CONTENT. Every value in the preview comes from a real run of a real dataset the caller is
    permitted to use.
    ============================================================================================
*@

<div class="d-flex flex-column flex-column-fluid">

    @* ---- TOOLBAR ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- *@
    @* pb-5, not pb-2. The action row and the page-setup strip below it are both light surfaces, and 8px
       between them read as ONE block stuck together — the separation has to be visible, not technically
       present. *@
    <div id="kt_app_toolbar" class="app-toolbar pt-6 pb-5">
        <div class="app-container container-fluid d-flex flex-stack flex-wrap gap-3">
            <div class="page-title d-flex flex-column justify-content-center gap-1">
                <h1 class="page-heading text-gray-900 fw-bold fs-3 m-0">
                    <i class="ki-outline ki-abstract-26 fs-2 me-2 text-primary"></i>@(arabic ? "استوديو التقارير" : "Report Studio")
                </h1>
                <ul class="breadcrumb breadcrumb-separatorless fw-semibold fs-7 my-0">
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item text-muted">
                        <a href="@Url.Action("Index","Inventory")" class="text-muted text-hover-primary">@SR["Inventory"]</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><span class="bullet bg-gray-500 w-5px h-2px"></span></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item text-muted">
                        <a href="@Url.Action("Index","Reports")" class="text-muted text-hover-primary">@(arabic ? "مركز التقارير" : "Reports Center")</a>
                    </li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><span class="bullet bg-gray-500 w-5px h-2px"></span></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item text-muted">@(arabic ? "مصمِّم التقارير" : "Report Designer")</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            @* TEN CONTROLS IN ONE LINE READ AS A WALL, which is what "the header is all crammed
               together" was: same-weight light buttons at a uniform 0.5rem gap, with two hairline
               separators doing all the grouping. They are grouped into btn-groups instead — adjacent
               buttons in a group share a border and read as ONE control with parts, which is Bootstrap's
               own answer to a row of buttons — and the space between GROUPS is widened while the space
               inside them goes to zero. Nothing is hidden and nothing is renamed; only the grouping and
               the gaps change.
               Order: what the DRAFT is (name) · what to START (new, clear) · undo · what to PRODUCE
               (preview, print, pdf, export) · save. *@
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 flex-wrap cbd-actions">
                @* TWO NAMES, both always present regardless of the UI language. The saved layout is shown
                   to Arabic and English users alike, so it needs a name in each; one field meant whatever
                   the author happened to type was copied into both columns, and an Arabic name then
                   appeared on the English screens. The field for the CURRENT language comes first. *@
                @if (arabic)
                {
                    <input id="cbd-name" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm w-175px"
                           placeholder="Report name (Arabic)" aria-label="Report name (Arabic)" />
                    <input id="cbd-name-en" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm w-175px"
                           placeholder="Report name (EN)" aria-label="Report name (English)" dir="ltr" />
                }
                else
                {
                    <input id="cbd-name-en" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm w-175px"
                           placeholder="Report name (EN)" aria-label="Report name (English)" dir="ltr" />
                    <input id="cbd-name" type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm w-175px"
                           placeholder="Report name (Arabic)" aria-label="Report name (Arabic)" dir="rtl" />
                }

                @* NEW and CLEAR are PAGE-level, and they sit here rather than beside the canvas footer's
                   Delete on purpose: that button removes what is SELECTED, these two remove the DESIGN.
                   Both ask before acting — neither is a click anyone wants to make by accident. *@
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-new" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-light"
                            title="@(arabic ? "تقرير جديد — يبدأ من صفحة فارغة" : "New report — start from an empty page")">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-file fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "جديد" : "New")
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-clear" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-light"
                            title="@(arabic ? "مسح كل عناصر الصفحة" : "Clear every element on the page")">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-cross fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "مسح" : "Clear")
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="btn-group">
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-undo" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light" disabled
                            title="@(arabic ? "تراجع" : "Undo") (Ctrl+Z)" aria-label="@(arabic ? "تراجع" : "Undo")">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-arrow-left fs-4"></i>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-redo" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light" disabled
                            title="@(arabic ? "إعادة" : "Redo") (Ctrl+Y)" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إعادة" : "Redo")">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-arrow-right fs-4"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="btn-group">
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-preview" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-light">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-eye fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "معاينة" : "Preview")
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-print" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-light">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-printer fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "طباعة" : "Print")
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-pdf" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-light">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-file-down fs-5 me-1"></i>PDF
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light dropdown-toggle" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-exit-down fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "تصدير" : "Export")
                    </button>
                    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                        <li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-export="3">CSV</button></li>
                        <li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item" data-export="2">Excel (XLSX)</button></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <button type="button" id="cbd-save" class="btn btn-sm btn-flex btn-primary">
                    <i class="ki-outline ki-check fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "حفظ" : "Save")
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="app-container container-fluid">

        @if (Model.HasNoDatasets)
        {
            @* A REAL STATE, not an error page: nothing this caller may build over. *@
            <div class="card card-flush">
                <div class="card-body text-center py-15">
                    <i class="ki-outline ki-information-5 fs-3x text-gray-400 mb-4 d-block"></i>
                    <div class="fw-bold fs-4 text-gray-800 mb-2">
                        @(arabic ? "لا توجد مجموعات بيانات متاحة لك" : "No data sets are available to you")
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-muted fs-6">
                        @(arabic
                            ? "يحتاج بناء التقارير إلى صلاحية على مجموعة بيانات واحدة على الأقل. تواصل مع مسؤول النظام."
                            : "Building a report needs permission on at least one data set. Ask your administrator.")
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            @* ---- PAGE SETUP STRIP -------------------------------------------------------------- *@
            @* mt-3 ON TOP of the toolbar's own bottom padding. Widening that padding alone took the gap
               from 8px to 21px and it still read as touching, because both surfaces are light and the
               card carries no shadow of its own — so the strip needs a margin that belongs to IT, not
               only space that belongs to the row above. Measured at 37px, which is finally a gap. *@
            <div class="card card-flush mt-3 mb-3">
                <div id="cbd-setup" class="card-body py-3 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3">

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <label class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted" for="cbd-paper">@(arabic ? "الورق" : "Paper")</label>
                        <select id="cbd-paper" class="form-select form-select-sm w-100px">
                            <option value="0">A4</option>
                            <option value="1">A5</option>
                            <option value="2">Letter</option>
                            <option value="3">Legal</option>
                            <option value="4">80mm</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <label class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted" for="cbd-orient">@(arabic ? "الاتجاه" : "Orientation")</label>
                        <select id="cbd-orient" class="form-select form-select-sm w-125px">
                            <option value="0">@(arabic ? "طولي" : "Portrait")</option>
                            <option value="1">@(arabic ? "عرضي" : "Landscape")</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    @* THE DOCUMENT FONT. Beside paper and margins because it is a property of the
                       PAGE, not of a selected element — the properties panel's font sets one box,
                       this sets the face everything inherits.

                       The list is the server's ReportTypography.DesignerFaces, which is also what
                       ReportVisualLayoutValidator accepts, so the designer cannot offer a face the
                       save would reject. "Default" means the platform stack for the run's language,
                       which is the right answer for a report read in both. *@
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <label class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted" for="cbd-font">@(arabic ? "الخط" : "Font")</label>
                        <select id="cbd-font" class="form-select form-select-sm w-140px">
                            <option value="">@(arabic ? "افتراضي" : "Default")</option>
                            @foreach (var face in CrossBuy.BL.Reporting.ReportTypography.DesignerFaces)
                            {
                                <option value="@face">@face</option>
                            }
                        </select>
                        <input id="cbd-fontsize" type="number" step="0.5" min="5" max="30"
                               class="form-control form-control-sm w-70px"
                               title="@(arabic ? "حجم الخط (نقطة)" : "Font size (pt)")"
                               aria-label="@(arabic ? "حجم خط المستند" : "Document font size")"
                               placeholder="@(arabic ? "نقطة" : "pt")" />
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-1 cbd-setup-wide">
                        <span class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted me-1">@(arabic ? "الهوامش (مم)" : "Margins (mm)")</span>
                        <input id="cbd-mt" type="number" step="1" min="0" class="form-control form-control-sm w-60px" title="@(arabic ? "أعلى" : "Top")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "هامش أعلى" : "Top margin")" />
                        <input id="cbd-mb" type="number" step="1" min="0" class="form-control form-control-sm w-60px" title="@(arabic ? "أسفل" : "Bottom")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "هامش أسفل" : "Bottom margin")" />
                        <input id="cbd-ml" type="number" step="1" min="0" class="form-control form-control-sm w-60px" title="@(arabic ? "يسار" : "Left")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "هامش يسار" : "Left margin")" />
                        <input id="cbd-mr" type="number" step="1" min="0" class="form-control form-control-sm w-60px" title="@(arabic ? "يمين" : "Right")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "هامش يمين" : "Right margin")" />
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 cbd-setup-wide">
                        <label class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted" for="cbd-grid">@(arabic ? "الشبكة" : "Grid")</label>
                        <input id="cbd-grid" type="number" step="1" min="1" max="20" class="form-control form-control-sm w-60px" aria-label="@(arabic ? "مقاس الشبكة" : "Grid size")" />
                        <div class="form-check form-check-sm form-check-custom">
                            <input id="cbd-snap" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" />
                            <label class="form-check-label fs-8 fw-semibold" for="cbd-snap">@(arabic ? "محاذاة" : "Snap")</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-check form-check-sm form-check-custom">
                            <input id="cbd-showgrid" class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" checked />
                            <label class="form-check-label fs-8 fw-semibold" for="cbd-showgrid">@(arabic ? "إظهار" : "Show")</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 ms-auto cbd-setup-wide">
                        <label class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-muted" for="cbd-zoom">@(arabic ? "تكبير" : "Zoom")</label>
                        <input id="cbd-zoom" type="range" min="40" max="200" step="10" value="100" class="w-125px" aria-label="@(arabic ? "تكبير" : "Zoom")" />
                        <span id="cbd-zoom-label" class="fs-8 fw-semibold text-gray-700 w-40px">100%</span>
                        <button type="button" id="cbd-fit" class="btn btn-sm btn-light">@(arabic ? "ملاءمة" : "Fit")</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            @* ---- THE THREE RAILS --------------------------------------------------------------- *@
            <div class="cbd-wrap">

                @* ---------------- THE DOCK BAR: tools, and saved reports ---------------------- *@
                @*
                    ONE 34px TAB STRIP ON THE EDGE, the way Visual Studio stacks its auto-hide tabs, with
                    the panel flying out OVER the canvas instead of taking a column of the row away from
                    it. Both panels were docked columns before: the toolbox rail held 290px permanently
                    even while nobody was adding an element, and the saved-reports list was a card at the
                    bottom of that rail with no scrollbar of its own — 53 saved reports made the page
                    1682px tall on a phone with the list itself far below the fold.

                    ONE OPEN AT A TIME, and they differ in ONE way on purpose: the reports list is a
                    PICKER, so it dismisses itself as soon as you click anywhere else; the toolbox is a
                    PALETTE you add from repeatedly, so it stays until you close it. An auto-hiding
                    toolbox would shut on the first canvas click after every single element.
                *@
                <div class="cbd-dockbar">
                    <div class="cbd-dockbar-tabs">
                    <button type="button" id="cbd-tools-tab" class="cbd-dock-tab" aria-expanded="false"
                            aria-controls="cbd-tools-panel"
                            title="@(arabic ? "الأدوات والبيانات والأقسام" : "Tools, data and bands")">
                        <i class="ki-outline ki-abstract-25 fs-6"></i>
                        <span>@(arabic ? "الأدوات" : "Tools")</span>
                    </button>

                    @if (Model.Saved.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <button type="button" id="cbd-saved-tab" class="cbd-dock-tab" aria-expanded="false"
                                aria-controls="cbd-saved-panel"
                                title="@(arabic ? "تقاريري المحفوظة" : "My saved reports")">
                            <i class="ki-outline ki-folder fs-6"></i>
                            <span>@(arabic ? "تقاريري" : "My reports")</span>
                            <span class="cbd-dock-count">@Model.Saved.Count</span>
                        </button>
                    }
                    </div>

                    @* ---- THE TOOLS PANEL (was a permanent 290px rail) ------------------------- *@
                    <div id="cbd-tools-panel" class="cbd-dock-panel cbd-dock-panel-wide" data-autohide="false" hidden>
                    <div class="card card-flush">
                        <div class="card-header min-h-40px px-3">
                            <ul class="nav nav-tabs nav-line-tabs nav-line-tabs-2x border-0 fs-8 fw-bold">
                                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active py-2" data-bs-toggle="tab" href="#cbd-tab-toolbox">@(arabic ? "الأدوات" : "Toolbox")</a></li>
                                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link py-2" data-bs-toggle="tab" href="#cbd-tab-data">@(arabic ? "البيانات" : "Data")</a></li>
                                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link py-2" data-bs-toggle="tab" href="#cbd-tab-bands">@(arabic ? "الأقسام" : "Bands")</a></li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="card-toolbar">
                                <button type="button" id="cbd-tools-close" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light w-25px h-25px"
                                        title="@(arabic ? "إغلاق" : "Close")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إغلاق" : "Close")">
                                    <i class="ki-outline ki-cross fs-6"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body p-3 cbd-rail-body">
                            <div class="tab-content">

                                @* ---- TOOLBOX ---- *@
                                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="cbd-tab-toolbox">
                                    <div class="text-muted fs-8 mb-2">
                                        @(arabic ? "اسحب أداة إلى الصفحة، أو انقر لإضافتها إلى القسم المحدد." : "Drag a tool onto the page, or click to add it to the selected band.")
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="cbd-toolbox" class="d-flex flex-column gap-1"></div>

                                    <div class="separator my-3"></div>

                                    <div class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">@(arabic ? "الصور" : "Images")</div>
                                    <div id="cbd-assets" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2"></div>
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                        <select id="cbd-asset-role" class="form-select form-select-sm w-100px" aria-label="@(arabic ? "دور الصورة" : "Image role")">
                                            <option value="1">@(arabic ? "شعار" : "Logo")</option>
                                            <option value="2">@(arabic ? "توقيع" : "Signature")</option>
                                            <option value="3">@(arabic ? "ختم" : "Stamp")</option>
                                            <option value="0">@(arabic ? "أخرى" : "Other")</option>
                                        </select>
                                        <label class="btn btn-sm btn-light-primary mb-0">
                                            <i class="ki-outline ki-cloud-add fs-5 me-1"></i>@(arabic ? "رفع" : "Upload")
                                            <input id="cbd-asset-file" type="file" accept="image/*" class="d-none" />
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                @* ---- DATA ---- *@
                                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="cbd-tab-data">
                                    <label class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 mb-1" for="cbd-dataset">@(arabic ? "مجموعة البيانات" : "Data set")</label>
                                    <select id="cbd-dataset" class="form-select form-select-sm mb-3">
                                        <option value="">@(arabic ? "— اختر —" : "— choose —")</option>
                                        @foreach (var d in Model.Datasets)
                                        {
                                            <option value="@d.DatasetCode" title="@d.Description">@d.Title (@d.Module)</option>
                                        }
                                    </select>

                                    <div class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">@(arabic ? "الحقول" : "Fields")</div>
                                    <div class="text-muted fs-8 mb-2">@(arabic ? "اسحب حقلًا إلى الصفحة." : "Drag a field onto the page.")</div>
                                    <div id="cbd-fields" class="d-flex flex-column gap-1 mb-3"></div>

                                    <div class="separator my-3"></div>

                                    @* §9 — the parameters the dataset itself declares. *@
                                    <div class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">@(arabic ? "المعاملات" : "Parameters")</div>
                                    <div id="cbd-params" class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-2"></div>
                                    <div id="cbd-params-empty" class="text-muted fs-8">@(arabic ? "لا توجد معاملات." : "No parameters.")</div>

                                    <div class="separator my-3"></div>

                                    <div class="d-flex flex-stack mb-1">
                                        <span class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700">@(arabic ? "المرشِّحات" : "Filters")</span>
                                        <button type="button" id="cbd-add-filter" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إضافة مرشِّح" : "Add filter")"><i class="ki-outline ki-plus fs-5"></i></button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="cbd-filters" class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-3"></div>

                                    <div class="d-flex flex-stack mb-1">
                                        <span class="fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700">@(arabic ? "الترتيب" : "Sorting")</span>
                                        <button type="button" id="cbd-add-sort" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إضافة ترتيب" : "Add sort")"><i class="ki-outline ki-plus fs-5"></i></button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="cbd-sorts" class="d-flex flex-column gap-2"></div>
                                </div>

                                @* ---- BANDS ---- *@
                                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="cbd-tab-bands">
                                    <div class="text-muted fs-8 mb-2">
                                        @(arabic ? "ارتفاع كل قسم بالمليمتر. القسم بارتفاع صفر لا يُطبع." : "Each band's height in millimetres. A band of height zero does not print.")
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="cbd-bandlist" class="d-flex flex-column gap-2"></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>

                    @* ---- THE SAVED-REPORTS PANEL --------------------------------------------- *@
                    @if (Model.Saved.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <div id="cbd-saved-panel" class="cbd-dock-panel card card-flush" data-autohide="true" hidden>
                            <div class="card-header min-h-40px px-3">
                                <h3 class="card-title fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 m-0">@(arabic ? "تقاريري" : "My reports")</h3>
                                <div class="card-toolbar">
                                    <button type="button" id="cbd-saved-close" class="btn btn-sm btn-icon btn-light w-25px h-25px"
                                            title="@(arabic ? "إغلاق" : "Close")" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إغلاق" : "Close")">
                                        <i class="ki-outline ki-cross fs-6"></i>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body p-3 d-flex flex-column gap-1 cbd-rail-body">
                                @foreach (var saved in Model.Saved)
                                {
                                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light justify-content-start fw-semibold fs-8 py-2 text-start"
                                            data-open="@saved.TemplateId" title="@saved.Name">
                                        <i class="ki-outline ki-file fs-5 me-2"></i>@saved.Name
                                    </button>
                                }
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>

                @* ---------------- CANVAS -------------------------------------------------------- *@
                <div class="cbd-stage">
                    <div class="cbd-ruler-corner"></div>
                    <div id="cbd-ruler-h" class="cbd-ruler-h" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                    <div id="cbd-ruler-v" class="cbd-ruler-v" aria-hidden="true"></div>

                    <div id="cbd-scroll" class="cbd-scroll">
                        <div id="cbd-page" class="cbd-page">
                            <div id="cbd-content" class="cbd-content"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cbd-statusbar">
                        <span id="cbd-status" class="fs-8 text-muted"></span>
                        <span class="ms-auto d-flex gap-1">
                            <button type="button" id="cbd-front" class="btn btn-sm btn-light py-1 px-2 fs-8" title="@(arabic ? "إلى الأمام" : "Bring to front")">
                                <i class="ki-outline ki-up-square fs-6"></i>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" id="cbd-back" class="btn btn-sm btn-light py-1 px-2 fs-8" title="@(arabic ? "إلى الخلف" : "Send to back")">
                                <i class="ki-outline ki-down-square fs-6"></i>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" id="cbd-dup" class="btn btn-sm btn-light py-1 px-2 fs-8" title="@(arabic ? "تكرار" : "Duplicate") (Ctrl+D)">
                                <i class="ki-outline ki-copy fs-6"></i>
                            </button>
                            <button type="button" id="cbd-del" class="btn btn-sm btn-light-danger py-1 px-2 fs-8" title="@(arabic ? "حذف" : "Delete") (Del)">
                                <i class="ki-outline ki-trash fs-6"></i>
                            </button>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                @* ---------------- RIGHT RAIL: properties ---------------------------------------- *@
                <div class="cbd-rail">
                    <div class="card card-flush">
                        <div class="card-header min-h-40px px-3">
                            <h3 class="card-title fs-8 fw-bold text-gray-700 m-0">@(arabic ? "الخصائص" : "Properties")</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body p-3 cbd-rail-body">
                            <div id="cbd-props"></div>
                            <div id="cbd-props-empty" class="text-muted fs-8 text-center py-10">
                                @(arabic ? "اختر عنصرًا لعرض خصائصه." : "Select an element to edit it.")
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="cbd-errors" class="alert alert-danger d-none mt-3 py-3 px-4 fs-8 mb-0"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</div>

@* ---- PREVIEW MODAL ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- *@
<div class="modal fade" id="cbd-preview-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-fullscreen-lg-down modal-xl">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header py-3">
                <h3 class="modal-title fs-5">@(arabic ? "معاينة الطباعة" : "Print preview")</h3>
                <div class="btn btn-icon btn-sm btn-active-light-primary ms-2" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="@(arabic ? "إغلاق" : "Close")">
                    <i class="ki-outline ki-cross fs-2"></i>
                </div>
